<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0596_T25R1005_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup. Oh, your homie...\nLemme read its energy...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0596_T25R1005_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s REAL attached to you.\nThis move perfect for a pair like y’all.\fLike matchin’ tattoos.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0596_T25R1005_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0596_T25R1005_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s ADORABLE!\rTeach it some good TMs.\nCute AND dangerous. Like my ex.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0596_T25R1005_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It look a lil EVIL.\nI respect that. Here’s a TM for it.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0596_T25R1005_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0596_T25R1005_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There’s TMs out there perfect for\nyour homie. Like soulmates but\fviolent.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0596_T25R1005_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Mystery Gift.\rOne lil beep and you get a gift.\nOr malware. It’s a mystery.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0596_T25R1005_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Mystery Gift don’t work with a Game\nBoy Color, grandpa. Update your\fstuff.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0596_T25R1005_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I collect homies.\nYou got a DROWZEE?\rWanna trade it for my MACHOP? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0596_T25R1005_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yesss! I got me a DROWZEE!\fGood looks!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0596_T25R1005_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh? That ain’t no DROWZEE.\nYou tried to finesse me...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0596_T25R1005_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You don’t wanna trade? Aww...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0596_T25R1005_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, how my old MACHOP doin’?\nIt still hittin’ the gym?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0596_T25R1005_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh? You...a FED now?!\nSince WHEN?! You switched up on us!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0596_T25R1005_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">On Sundays, a lady come through to\ncheck out homies. She give away TMs!\fNobody know who she is. Free stuff\ntho.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0596_T25R1005_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Feds... Why they here? They need\nTMs for what?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0596_T25R1005_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You can’t rename a homie you got in a\ntrade.\rThe name show how the original Hustler\nfelt. Even if they named it “Butt.”</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0596_T25R1005_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You shouldn’t wear a black suit like\nthat. People gon’ think you a Fed.\rWhat?! You ARE one?! I ain’t said\nNOTHIN’!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0596_T25R1005_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Upgrade Your Homies\n5F TM Corner</language>
	</row>
</body>
